aching millions of people are  desperately in need of aid and we've  been seeing visits from the united  nations bodies the world health  organizations doctors without borders  everybody underlining the fact that the  international community  has probably weeks not months to act and  they have they cannot use the aid and  the afghan money that they're frozen as  a bargaining chip to put taliban into  the shape that they want them to be  osama bin javed there in kabul thanks  osama talk to you later
 

